<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/T ("INDmoney aims to be a one-stop solution for managing personal finances but lacks a comprehensive lending product to leverage user financial data. This gap limits personalized credit offerings, affecting user retention, engagement, and revenue growth. A seamless, integrated lending solution tailored to individual financial health is needed.")
/E ("INDmoney aims to be a one-stop solution for managing personal finances but lacks a comprehensive lending product to leverage user financial data. This gap limits personalized credit offerings, affecting user retention, engagement, and revenue growth. A seamless, integrated lending solution tailored to individual financial health is needed.")
